commit c8dabc63e7018d0b1567b2171f8df5dd8a334a55
Author: Alessio Pollero <alessio.pollero@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 5 01:44:25 2026 +0400

    Fix the x86_64 build of the EmbeddingGemma 2 image processor (#763)
    
    EmbeddingGemma2ImageProcessor.pixels creates its array with
    `type: Float16.self`. mlx-swift adds `Float16: HasDType` only outside
    x86_64 (`#if !arch(x86_64)`), so universal builds, such as an app
    Release or archive for "Any Mac", fail with "Initializer
    'init(_:_:type:)' requires that 'Float16' conform to 'HasDType'".
    
    Use `dtype: .float16`, which reads the same bytes on every
    architecture.

