commit 2fdad9ea16f763688897182b7db3f581b47d5808
Author: a11 <augstar@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 5 01:16:16 2026 +0800

    Keep Nemotron-H Mamba activations in the input dtype (#754)
    
    The gated RMS norm passed a float32 identity weight into rmsNorm, which
    returns the promoted type of the input and the weight. Mamba outputs, and
    the residual stream after the first Mamba layer, became float32.

