commit eccf77424ef058a7267a1837e280f2fb191562a1
Author: Alessio Pollero <alessio.pollero@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 3 22:25:52 2026 +0400

    Fix EmbeddingGemma 2 image orientation and batch text embeddings (#692)
    
    * Fix EmbeddingGemma 2 image orientation and batch text embeddings
    * Add MultimodalEmbedding contract and factory for media embedding models
    * ⚡ Embeddings: Reduce EmbeddingGemma 2 image preprocessing memory
    
    Keep source pixels in half precision and cast samples during the antialiased
    resize. This removes full-resolution float32 staging while preserving JPEG's
    extended range and the CPU path.
    
    Add pixel comparisons for PNG/JPEG, CPU/GPU execution, and resize shapes.
    
    AI assistance: Codex implemented the code and tests.

